Daniel Sturridge saved Liverpool from losing to Chelsea in the Premier League by tieing up the 89th minute at Stamford Bridge, London.
Sturridge received a pass from Xherdan Shaqir, about 27 yards from Chelsea's goal, when his team led by 1: 0.
