Trump West Virginia Election Campaign Event, YouTube Channel
President Donald Trump will start his election series this evening in Wheeling, West Virginia.
It's Trump's first campaign event planned for next week out of five, including stops in friendly venues such as Tennessee and Mississippi.
While the confirmation vote stands as long as Trump chooses who to be appointed to a vacancy seat by the Supreme Court, he seeks to increase support for the upcoming midterm elections, as Republicans are threatened to lose control of Congress after the November vote.
At what time is Trump's campaign tonight in West Virginia and how to view it on the Internet?
Trump's campaign in West Virginia will take place this Saturday evening at 19:00 p.m. East Coast time on September 29, 2018.
Trump's West Virginia campaign can be watched online via YouTube streaming.
